{
  "name": "blas",
  "description": "This library provides a high-level Rust interface to the Basic Linear Algebra Subprograms (BLAS), wrapping the low-level FFI bindings provided by libblas-sys. It facilitates standard numerical operations including scalar-vector, matrix-vector, and matrix-matrix transformations with support for both real and complex precision. The implementation focuses on providing a safe, idiomatic API while maintaining the performance profile of optimized BLAS backends like OpenBLAS or Netlib.",
